<title>PHILIPPINES: Zeus Holdings approves capital increase.</title>
<headline>Zeus Holdings approves capital increase.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zeus Holdings Inc said on Tuesday its shareholders had approved the increase in the company's authorised capital stock to 3.0 billion pesos from 100 million pesos.</p>
<p>Zeus Holdings was formerly a garment company which decided to sell its assets to become a holding company.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
